#: gnu/bootloader.scm:126
msgid ""
"Please chose only one of:\n"
"@enumerate\n"
"@item direct boot by specifying fields @code{linux},\n"
"@code{linux-arguments} and @code{linux-modules},\n"
"@item multiboot by specifying fields @code{multiboot-kernel},\n"
"@code{multiboot-arguments} and @code{multiboot-modules},\n"
"@item chain-loader by specifying field @code{chain-loader}.\n"
"@end enumerate"
msgstr ""
"다음 중 하나만 선택하십시오:\n"
"@enumerate\n"
"@item @code{linux}, @code{linux-arguments} 및 @code{linux-modules} 필드를 지"
"정하는 직접 부팅(direct boot),\n"
"@item @code{multiboot-kernel}, @code{multiboot-arguments} 및 @code{multiboot-"
"modules} 필드를 지정하는 멀티부팅(multiboot),\n"
"@item @code{chain-loader} 필드를 지정하는 체인 로더(chain-loader).\n"
"@end enumerate"

