#: guix/lint.scm:2230
msgid "Check the Common Vulnerabilities and Exposures (CVE) database"
msgstr "CVE(Common Vulnerabilities and Exposures) 데이터베이스 확인"

#: guix/lint.scm:2235
msgid "Check the package for new upstream releases"
msgstr "패키지의 새 업스트림 릴리스 확인"

#: guix/lint.scm:2239
