#: guix/scripts/system/reconfigure.scm:384 guix/channels.scm:540
msgid ""
"Use @option{--allow-downgrades} to force\n"
"this downgrade."
msgstr ""
"이 다운그레이드를 강제하려면 @option{--allow-downgrades} 옵션을\n"
"사용하십시오."

#: guix/scripts/system/reconfigure.scm:439
#, scheme-format
