msgstr "Composer 패키지용 업데이트 도구"

#: guix/scripts/import/cpan.scm:42
msgid ""
"Usage: guix import cpan PACKAGE-NAME\n"
"Import and convert the CPAN package for PACKAGE-NAME.\n"
